# Simple retransmission (no sequence wrapping)
# Client: 10.0.0.1:8000 -> Server: 10.0.0.2:80
# ISN_client=5000, ISN_server=6000
# Client sends 100 bytes, retransmits once, then clean close
# Server sends no application data
#
# ts_ms  src               dst               flags seq  ack  win    payload
0        10.0.0.1:8000     10.0.0.2:80       S     5000 0    65535  0
50       10.0.0.2:80       10.0.0.1:8000     SA    6000 5001 32768  0
55       10.0.0.1:8000     10.0.0.2:80       A     5001 6001 65535  0
# Client sends 100 bytes
100      10.0.0.1:8000     10.0.0.2:80       PA    5001 6001 65535  100
# Retransmission of same segment (no ACK received in time)
200      10.0.0.1:8000     10.0.0.2:80       PA    5001 6001 65535  100
# ACK finally arrives
250      10.0.0.2:80       10.0.0.1:8000     A     6001 5101 32768  0
# Clean close
300      10.0.0.1:8000     10.0.0.2:80       FA    5101 6001 65535  0
350      10.0.0.2:80       10.0.0.1:8000     A     6001 5102 32768  0
400      10.0.0.2:80       10.0.0.1:8000     FA    6001 5102 32768  0
450      10.0.0.1:8000     10.0.0.2:80       A     5102 6002 65535  0
